<title>USA: Microdyne names Massoud Safavi CFO.</title>
<headline>Microdyne names Massoud Safavi CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microdyne Corp said that Monday it has named Massoud Safavi as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Chris Spitz as chief financial officer. Spitz, who is also senior vp aerospace telemetry, will continue in that role.</p>
<p>Safavi, 44, joins Microdyne from UNC Inc his positions included assistant treasurer, division chief financial officer, and director of special projects and audit.</p>
